# HydraDAW — cabeceras Cloudflare Pages.
# COOP same-origin + COEP credentialless en prod; dev usa require-corp
# (vite.config.ts). Web Audio no exige aislamiento cross-origin; se
# mantienen por higiene futura (SharedArrayBuffer / WASM threads).
# Permissions-Policy: solo self puede pedir microfono (grabacion local).
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Permissions-Policy: microphone=(self)

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
